<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix F Design Details and Discussions ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Success rate settings and discount factor weighting</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix F Design Details and Discussions ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Train/test split</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix F Design Details and Discussions ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Weighted average of success rates under all tasks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In Appendix F Design Details and Discussions ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Validity of the approximation in Equation <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In Appendix F Design Details and Discussions ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Design of the prompt</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
