<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Derivation of Formulas</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide a simple derivation of Equation <a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.2 Preference Fine-Tuning with CoT ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.
During the RL phase with reward model, the object of training is to maximize returns. Following prior works the optimization is formulated as:</p>
<table id="A2.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\max_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}_{s\sim D,a\sim\pi_{\theta}(a|s)}[Q(s,a)]-\beta\mathrm{D_{KL}}[\pi_{\theta}\parallel\pi_{ref}]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></munder><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>KL</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}_{s\sim D,a\sim\pi_{\theta}(a|s)}[Q(s,a)]-\beta\mathrm{D_{KL}}[\pi_{\theta}\parallel\pi_{ref}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">which can be rewritten as:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\max_{\pi_{\theta}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><munder><mi>max</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></munder><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\max_{\pi_{\theta}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex2.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{s\sim D,a\sim\pi_{\theta}(a|s)}[Q(s,a)]-\beta\mathrm{D_{KL}}[\pi_{\theta}\parallel\pi_{ref}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>KL</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{s\sim D,a\sim\pi_{\theta}(a|s)}[Q(s,a)]-\beta\mathrm{D_{KL}}[\pi_{\theta}\parallel\pi_{ref}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\max_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}[Q(s,a)-\beta\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\max_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}[Q(s,a)-\beta\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\min_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}[\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)}}-\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a)]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>min</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>β</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\min_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}[\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)}}-\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a)]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\min_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}[\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)\exp{(\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a))}}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>min</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>β</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\min_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}[\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)\exp{(\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a))}}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\min_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}_{s\sim D}[\mathrm{D_{KL}}[\pi(a|s)\parallel\tilde{\pi}(a|s)]]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>min</mi><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></munder><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>KL</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\min_{\pi_{\theta}}\mathbb{E}_{s\sim D}[\mathrm{D_{KL}}[\pi(a|s)\parallel\tilde{\pi}(a|s)]]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\pi}(a|s)=\pi_{ref}(a|s)\exp{(\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a))}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>β</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\pi}(a|s)=\pi_{ref}(a|s)\exp{(\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a))}</annotation></semantics></math>. KL-divergence is minimized at zero if and only if the two distributions are identical. Therefore, in the case of the optimal solution we get:</p>
<table id="A2.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi(a|s)=\tilde{\pi}(a|s)=\pi_{ref}(a|s)\exp{(\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a))}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>β</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi(a|s)=\tilde{\pi}(a|s)=\pi_{ref}(a|s)\exp{(\frac{1}{\beta}Q(s,a))}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">A simple transformation yields:</p>
<table id="A2.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q(s,a)=\beta\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q(s,a)=\beta\log{\frac{\pi(a|s)}{\pi_{ref}(a|s)}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">We can know from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yang et al. (2024)</a></cite> that the Q-value form of Bradley-Terry preference distribution can be expressed as:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle p(\tau_{1}&gt;\tau_{2}|a_{i}^{t},s_{i}^{t},a_{i}^{t-1}...,s_{i}^{0})_{i\in\{{1,2}\}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p(\tau_{1}&gt;\tau_{2}|a_{i}^{t},s_{i}^{t},a_{i}^{t-1}...,s_{i}^{0})_{i\in\{{1,2}\}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\exp(Q(s_{1}^{t},a_{1}^{t}))}{\sum_{i\in\{{1,2}\}}\exp{(Q(s_{i}^{t},a_{i}^{t}))}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\exp(Q(s_{1}^{t},a_{1}^{t}))}{\sum_{i\in\{{1,2}\}}\exp{(Q(s_{i}^{t},a_{i}^{t}))}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Combining Eq. <a href="#A2.E11" title="In Appendix B Derivation of Formulas ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> and Eq. <a href="#A2.Ex8" title="In Appendix B Derivation of Formulas ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, replacing <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{i}^{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{i}^{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(a_{i}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{i}^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(a_{i}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{i}^{t})</annotation></semantics></math>, we derive the following loss function:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}=-\mathbb{E}_{\zeta}\log\sigma[\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(a_{1}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{1}^{t}|\tau_{1}^{t-1})}{\pi_{ref}(a_{1}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{1}^{t}|\tau_{1}^{t-1})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>ζ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}=-\mathbb{E}_{\zeta}\log\sigma[\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(a_{1}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{1}^{t}|\tau_{1}^{t-1})}{\pi_{ref}(a_{1}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{1}^{t}|\tau_{1}^{t-1})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(a_{2}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{2}^{t}|\tau_{2}^{t-1})}{\pi_{ref}(a_{2}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{2}^{t}|\tau_{2}^{t-1})}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(a_{2}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{2}^{t}|\tau_{2}^{t-1})}{\pi_{ref}(a_{2}^{t},\mathcal{T}_{2}^{t}|\tau_{2}^{t-1})}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.7" class="ltx_p">which is similar to Eq. <a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.2 Preference Fine-Tuning with CoT ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ TCPO: Thought-Centric Preference Optimization forEffective Embodied Decision-making" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a></p>
</div>
